# Title: <Short descriptive title>
# Description: <one-line description of what is detected>
# Author: <Your Name>
# Date: 2026-01-01
# MITRE ATT&CK: TXXXX, TXXXX.YYY
# Tactic: execution | persistence | defense_evasion | ...
# Severity: high
# References:
#   - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/TXXXX/
#   - https://example.com/threat-report
# False Positives:
#   - Aktivitas administratif resmi yang menggunakan tool yang sama.

index=windows OR index=endpoint
sourcetype IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational", "WinEventLog:Security")
Image="*\\example.exe"
(CommandLine="*suspicious-flag*" OR CommandLine="*another-flag*")
NOT (ParentImage="*\\trusted_parent.exe")
| stats count, values(CommandLine) as cmd, values(User) as user by host, Image, ParentImage
| where count > 0
| sort - _time
